    "text": "By WGLT ,\n5 hours ago It will cost most incoming Illinois State University undergraduate students about $1,143 more next school year, according to recommendations the administration is making to the Board of Trustees. That’s about a 4.15% overall increase in tuition, fees, room and board. Trustees on Friday will consider making the undergraduate total cost... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
